ilarité compare des profils par 90 minutes (tirs, passes, xT, défense…), pas le talent. Mais ça donne des idées au mercato."},"en":{"lead":"If F. Schär had a lookalike in the numbers, it would be Trent Sainsbury ({TN:Australia}, 2018 World Cup): 88% similar.","keys":["Y. Sommer ↔ Mike Maignan (Euro 2024, 100%).","V. Behrami ↔ Tyler Adams (2022 World Cup, 98%).","G. Xhaka ↔ Toni Kroos (Euro 2020, 97%)."],"impact":"A twin is not a clone: similarity compares per-90 profiles (shots, passes, xT, defending…), not talent. Still, it gives transfer ideas."}}}}